<title>USA: Hot Topic IPO soars.</title>
<headline>Hot Topic IPO soars.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Hot Topic Inc surged 60 percent in their first day of trading after the company's initial public offering.</p>
<p>Hot Topic opened at 29-1/4, up 11-1/4, and remained about 11 points higher in the first minutes of activity after the shares opened for trading on Nasdaq.  </p>
<p>The apparel company offered 1.3 million shares priced at $18, the high end of its target pricing range of $16-$18.</p>
<p>Analysts had expected strong demand for Hot Topic, which postponed a planned IPO in July due to popor market conditions.</p>
<p>In its initial regulatory filing, Hot Topic had planned to offer 1.25 million shares at $15-$17.</p>
